			"Message": "feat(Project): update submodules with service interfaces and binary refactoring\n\nUpdate 5 Element submodules with coordinated changes:\n\n- **Wind**: Add 6 new VS Code service interfaces (Commands, Editor, Extensions, Files, Language, TextFile) with Effect-TS abstractions including problem types, context tags, stub implementations, and Live/Mock layers\n- **Air**: Add Linux package features (appimage, deb, rpm) to Cargo.toml and update Mist imports to PascalCase convention\n- **Mountain**: Extract binary entry point from Library.rs to dedicated Source/Binary.rs following Rust best practices\n- **Rest**: Separate main function into Binary.rs entry point, updating Cargo.toml for standard Rust project structure\n- **Mist**: Submodule update to b598eaae\n\nThese changes advance the VS Code extension host API surface in Wind while standardizing binary entry point organization across Mountain and Rest.",
